<title>UK: London banks' election night trading plans - table.</title>
<headline>London banks' election night trading plans - table.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are London banks' trading plans for equities, forex and gilts through the night of the May 1 British election, based on information from bank press officers, analysts and senior dealers as of Tuesday.</p>
<p>The list may be updated again closer to the election.</p>
<p>* denotes gilt-edged market maker</p>
<p>** indicates plans not finalised or unavailable for comment  BANK			  EQUITIES	  FX	     GILTS</p>
